# Post-session quality gates

After every coding turn or session in this repository, before finishing, run quality checks from the **greenlight** monorepo root:

```bash
npm run check
```

This runs, in order:

1. `npm run fallow` — [Fallow](https://docs.fallow.tools/) static analysis
2. `npm run lint` — ESLint (deprecations are errors)
3. `npm run format:check` — Prettier check

## If checks fail

- **Format only:** run `npm run format`, then re-run `npm run check`
- **Lint / deprecation errors:** fix the reported issues; do not leave `@deprecated` usage or Node deprecation warnings from lint
- **Fallow findings:** triage using [Fallow docs](https://docs.fallow.tools/); fix or intentionally configure (entry points / ignorePatterns). Prefer fixing over suppressing

Do not hand off work with a failing `npm run check`.
